00:06:40,893 --> 00:06:41,810
Angle two.

205
00:06:41,990 --> 00:06:43,081
The psychology.

206
00:06:43,261 --> 00:06:45,252
The mental trap at each stage,

207
00:06:45,252 --> 00:06:46,779
