223
00:07:11,289 --> 00:07:12,306
because it is.

224
00:07:12,486 --> 00:07:13,949
Many people never reach it.

225
00:07:14,129 --> 00:07:16,842
Researchers have found that people are more

226
00:07:16,842 --> 00:07:19,240
