227
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:19,934
achievable.

228
00:07:20,114 --> 00:07:22,467
So don't stare at one hundred thousand

229
00:07:22,467 --> 00:07:22,715
yet.

230
00:07:22,895 --> 00:07:24,578
